-- A call script for examples/zk.lang (S10 Parts 3, 4 and 5). Each call is NOW CALLER NAME ARGS.
-- zkBorrow and zkRepay take the public delta d and the blinding r (S10 Part 4).
-- S10 Part 5: aa is the founder (init), the only member at deploy. ok: aa proposes ee.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000ee
-- revert: bb is not a member and cannot vote.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb zkVote 1
-- ok: aa votes yes, then the amend admits ee (2 x 1 aye > 1 member).
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkVote 1
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkAmend
-- ok: ee proposes ff and aa votes yes; revert: 2 x 1 aye = 2 members does not admit.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000ee zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000ff
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkVote 1
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkAmend
-- ok: ee votes no, then the amend rejects ff (2 x 1 nay >= 2 members).
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000ee zkVote 0
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkAmend
-- ok: ee exits (the self-exit zkDepart).
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000ee zkDepart
-- ok: the first borrow from the identity: 7u 11u stores cKA, the deadline 1 + 7 = 8.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkBorrow 7u 11u
-- ok: the full repay returns to the identity and clears the deadline.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkRepay 7u 11u
-- revert: the repay cleared the deadline.
9 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkLiquidate 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa
-- ok: borrow again, the deadline 8.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkBorrow 7u 11u
-- revert: at the deadline.
8 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkLiquidate 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa
-- ok: after the deadline, the position forfeits.
9 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkLiquidate 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa
-- revert: the position is Forfeited.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkBorrow 7u 11u
-- ok: aa (liquidated, still a member) admits bb.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkVote 1
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkAmend
-- revert: aa is a member (zkLiquidate keeps the flag), so bb cannot propose it.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa
-- ok: bb borrows 5u 13u.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb zkBorrow 5u 13u
-- ok: bb repays 20u 13u, more than the 5u it owes: the position wraps mod q.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb zkRepay 20u 13u
-- ok: excess repayment keeps the deadline on the wrapped commitment.
9 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb zkLiquidate 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb
-- revert: no member can propose the liquidated bb (still a member).
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb
-- ok: aa and bb admit cc (2 x 2 ayes > 2 members).
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkVote 1
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb zkVote 1
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkAmend
-- ok: zero and partial repayments keep cc's original deadline 8.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc zkBorrow 7u 11u
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc zkRepay 0u 0u
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc zkRepay 5u 5u
-- revert at the deadline, ok after it, then cc cannot propose itself (a member).
8 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc zkLiquidate 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc
9 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc zkLiquidate 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc
-- ok: aa and bb admit dd (2 x 2 ayes > 3 members).
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000dd
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkVote 1
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb zkVote 1
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkAmend
-- ok: both scalars are q + 1. Repayment cancels the borrow to the identity.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000dd zkBorrow 21888242871839275222246405745257275088548364400416034343698204186575808495618u 21888242871839275222246405745257275088548364400416034343698204186575808495618u
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000dd zkRepay 21888242871839275222246405745257275088548364400416034343698204186575808495618u 21888242871839275222246405745257275088548364400416034343698204186575808495618u
-- revert: full cancellation cleared dd's deadline.
9 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000dd zkLiquidate 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000dd
-- ok: cc (liquidated, the deadline 8 open) exits.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc zkDepart
-- revert: the Part 4 guard: no member can propose cc again.
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa zkPropose 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000cc
